// Potential RipZip Attack on Startup Folder | T1547 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_ripzip_attack.yml
from * metadata _id, _index, _version | where file.path like "*\\Microsoft\\Windows\\Start Menu\\Programs\\Startup*" and file.path like "*.lnk.{0AFACED1-E828-11D1-9187-B532F1E9575D}*" and ends_with(process.executable.caseless, "\\explorer.exe")
